    Settings, true, Use the Dryness feature to create automn scenaries. The main
    advantage of using the feature is local control over coloring__ smoothness and
    subsurface effects. Please note__ when using Dryness__ Overlay and Wetness with
    elements__ the same global textures are used__ making the rendering more optimized
    compared to using Tinting for seasonsEXCNEWNEWUse the Blend Mask options to change
